        "headings": [
          "H2: LPAS designs commercial environments that balance brand identity, performance, and long-term value. From workplace campu"
        ],
        "imgCount": 0,
        "videoCount": 0,
        "svgCount": 0,
        "linkCount": 0,
        "text": "Design for business value\nLPAS designs commercial environments that balance brand identity, performance, and long-term value. From workplace campuses and tenant improvements to retail and mixed-use developments, our process connects business goals to design outcomes.\n\nWe understand that commercial spaces must deliver on multiple levels: supporting productivity, reflecting brand identity, attracting and retaining talent or customers, and providing measurable return on investment. Our integrated approach combines architecture, interior design, and technical expertise to create environments that respond to evolving workplace trends, changing retail models, and the increasing importance of employee wellbeing and customer experience. We focus on efficiency, adaptability, and experience, creating spaces that reflect each client's culture and enhance the way people work, shop, and connect."
      },
      {
        "i": 2,
        "tag": "div",
        "id": null,
        "classes": "pin-spacer",
        "dataAttrs": {},
        "height": 2445,
        "width": 1440,
        "bg": "rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)",
        "color": "rgb(17, 17, 17)",
        "position": "relative",
        "childCount": 1,
        "headings": [
          "H2: Our Process"
        ],
        "imgCount": 5,
        "videoCount": 0,
        "svgCount": 7,
        "linkCount": 5,
        "text": "Workflow\n\nThe LPAS Commercial Design Process\nOur Process\n\nPhases\n\n01\nDiscovery + Brand Alignment\n02\nVisioning + Concept Development\n03\nPlanning + Performance\n04\nDetailing + Technical Coordination\n05\nDelivery + Evolution\n01\nPurpose-led clarity\nDiscovery + Brand Alignment\n\nEvery successful commercial project starts with clarity. LPAS begins by understanding our client's goals, brand identity, and operational model. We don't apply cookie-cutter solutions; we discover what makes your business unique. We study how people use space and how design can improve their experience. This early discovery phase establishes a strategic foundation that connects business needs with creative direction.\n\n02\nExpressing identity through space\nVisioning + Concept Development\n\nLPAS develops a clear and cohesive design concept that communicates brand story and purpose. We explore how materials, light, and propor"
      },
      {
        "i": 3,
        "tag": "section",
        "id": null,
        "classes": "blockWysiwyg",
        "dataAttrs": {
          "grid": "grid-template",
