        "position": "static",
        "childCount": 3,
        "headings": [
          "H2: LPAS Commercial Services"
        ],
        "imgCount": 0,
        "videoCount": 0,
        "svgCount": 0,
        "linkCount": 0,
        "text": "Integrated Commercial Expertise\nLPAS Commercial Services\n\nIntegrated Architecture + Interior Design:\nFull-service design with architecture and interior design teams collaborating in the same BIM model.\n\nWorkplace Strategy Expertise:\nActivity-based working, hybrid work support, and evidence-based design for productivity and wellbeing.\n\nWELL Building Leadership:\nWELL AP expertise bringing healthy building principles to commercial projects.\n\nSustainable Design:\nLEED experience and sustainable strategies reducing operating costs and supporting corporate responsibility.\n\nFast-Track Delivery:\nDisciplined project management supporting compressed schedules and lease obligations.\n\nReal Estate Intelligence:\nTest fits and feasibility studies supporting site selection and lease negotiations."
      },
      {
        "i": 4,
        "tag": "section",
        "id": null,
        "classes": "blockWysiwyg",
        "dataAttrs": {
